<title>AUSTRIA: VA Tech unit wins Siemens order.</title>
<headline>VA Tech unit wins Siemens order.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>VA Technologie AG said on Tuesday its Austrian Energy unit had won a 180 million schillings contract from Siemens.</p>
<p>Austrian Energy will install and start up two heat recovery boilers at the Poolbeg power plant in Ireland, VA Tech said in a statement. The plant is operated by ESB Power Generation.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
